{"id":"W92bceeeb0ded585ccd0358e8","zh":"本征模态函数","en":"","name":"本征模态函数","language":"zh","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"C84ea4d029a0c2b35a0be","families":[{"id":"signal.time-frequency","label":"信号与时频分析"}],"definition_zh":"经验模态分解中用于表达局部振荡成分的模态函数。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W92bceeeb0ded585ccd0358e8","text":"本征模态函数","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S20bc9339c8412ecc222e","source_id":"P110","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"当信号满足下列条件时:(1)分析数据的极值点与过零点交替出现,且数量相等或最多相差一个;(2)在任一点上,由信号最大值与最小值组成的两个包络的均值为零,此信号可称为本征模态函数。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S3f4d412d614722141c3f","source_id":"P110","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"对于时-频联合分析方法在时域(即空间域)中有效性的验证,本文根据时-频能量密度的计算结果,对每一个时域分布点取频域能量密度的平均值,以第一阶本征模态函数为例,验证联合方法对峰值检测的有效性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"Sc3df18f3a6f836eda8b3","source_id":"P122","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"一个本征模态函数(IMF)必须满足下面2 个条件[11−12]:在整个数据段内,极值点的个数和过零点的个数必须相等或相差最多不能超过1 个;在任意时刻,由局部极大值点形成的上包络线和由局部极小值点形成的下包络线的平均值为0,即上、下包络线相对于时间轴局部对称。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P092":{"id":"P092","title":"Identification of wheel-rail forces on high-speed railways based on physical model and hybrid recursive neural networks","authors":"H Liu, L Song, L Xu, Z Yu","year":"2025","doi":"10.1016/j.engstruct.2025.120547","journal_citation":"Engineering Structures 338, 120547","label":"Liu等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-identification-of-wheel-rail-forces-on-high-speed-railways-based-on-physical-model-and-hybrid-recurs"},"P110":{"id":"P110","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2017","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2017.04.002","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-time-frequency-energy-joint-analysis-method-for-railway-track-irregularity"},"P122":{"id":"P122","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,李晓健,孟宪洪","year":"2013","doi":null,"journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"满足极值点、过零点及包络均值条件的分解分量。","language":"zh","source_id":"P122","paper_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"EMD分解所得分量，满足极值、过零点及包络均值条件。","language":"zh","source_id":"P110","paper_slug":"2017-time-frequency-energy-joint-analysis-method-for-railway-track-irregularity","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"VMD得到的信号分量，具有相应中心频率和带宽。","language":"zh","source_id":"P092","paper_slug":"2025-identification-of-wheel-rail-forces-on-high-speed-railways-based-on-physical-model-and-hybrid-recurs","title":"基于物理模型与混合递归神经网络的高速铁路轮轨力识别","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W20b2060d5cf9310f12ebe428","name":"intrinsic mode function","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wcb9acb6238d099f57cc89eae","name":"Intrinsic mode function (IMF)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W20b2060d5cf9310f12ebe428","name":"intrinsic mode function","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wcb9acb6238d099f57cc89eae","name":"Intrinsic mode function (IMF)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W20b2060d5cf9310f12ebe428","name":"intrinsic mode function","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wcb9acb6238d099f57cc89eae","name":"Intrinsic mode function (IMF)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":n